+| `testSSHArgumentsMatchHardenedTunnelSetup` | asserts the complete SSH argument vector byte-for-byte as Swift strings | `swift test --filter TunnelConfigurationTests.testSSHArgumentsMatchHardenedTunnelSetup` |
